    <statement><p>A 17 foot ladder is leaning against a wall.</p>
<p>If the top slips down the wall at a rate of 4 ft/s,
how fast will the foot be moving away from the wall when the top is
16 feet above the ground?</p>
<p>The foot will be moving at <fillin characters="25" name="AnSwEr0001"/> ft/s.</p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>11.141</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
